    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d172">

                <pb facs="0380" n="360" xml:id="pg360"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Adams.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1164.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-29"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 29, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> The enclosed copy of a communication, of
                    the 25th instant, from the War Department, is transmitted to you with a view to
                    a proper representation being addressed by you to Earl Russell in regard to the
                    subject to which it chiefly relates, namely, the existence and movements of an
                    organized body of enemies of the United States at Marysburg, in Prince Edward’s
                    county, Canada.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Francis Adams,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d172-a1.xml" xpointer="d172-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d172-a2.xml" xpointer="d172-a2"/>
